<rml>
<head>
    <title>RmlUi test</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: LatoLatin;
            font-size: 16dp;
            color: #3b2a1a;
            position: absolute;
            left: 24dp;
            bottom: 24dp;
            width: 260dp;
            padding: 14dp 18dp;
            background-color: #efe2c4f0;
            border: 3dp #6b4a2b;
            border-radius: 6dp;
        }
        h1 { display: block; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20dp; margin-bottom: 8dp; }
        p { display: block; margin-bottom: 10dp; }
        button {
            display: block;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 6dp;
            color: #f4ead2;
            background-color: #7a5230;
            border: 2dp #3f2a17;
            border-radius: 4dp;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover { background-color: #95663d; }
        button:active { background-color: #5c3d22; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>RmlUi is running</h1>
    <p>A test panel for the UI switch. Clicks here stay in the UI; clicks beside it still reach the world.</p>
    <button>Hover and click me</button>
</body>
</rml>
